{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6eb40db2-f6fc-4aaa-9b12-personrecipe001",
    "name": "个人菜谱后端 API",
    "description": "Spring Boot + MyBatis 个人菜谱后端完整接口集合。\n\n使用说明：\n1. 修改集合变量 baseUrl（默认 http://localhost:8080）。\n2. 真实微信登录时，把 wxCode 改为 wx.login() 返回的临时 code。\n3. 本地联调可用 WECHAT_MOCK_ENABLED=true 启动，此时 wxCode 会直接作为 openid。\n4. 登录成功后脚本自动保存 token；创建菜谱成功后自动保存 recipeId；通用图片上传自动保存 coverImageUrl；头像上传自动保存 avatarUrl。\n5. 图片/头像上传请求需要在 Body 中重新选择本机图片文件，imageFilePath / avatarFilePath 仅作说明。\n\n响应约定：code=200 表示成功。参数校验通常返回 HTTP 400；鉴权拦截失败返回 HTTP 401；业务异常（如菜谱不存在）当前由项目代码返回 HTTP 200，但响应体 code 为 404。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "wxCode",
      "value": "postman-mock-openid-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "recipeId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "coverImageUrl",
      "value": "/uploads/2026/07/26/cover.jpg",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ingredientImageUrl",
      "value": "/uploads/2026/07/26/ingredient.jpg",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "stepImageUrl",
      "value": "/uploads/2026/07/26/step.jpg",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "imageFilePath",
      "value": "C:/path/to/image.jpg",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "avatarUrl",
      "value": "/uploads/2026/07/26/avatar.jpg",
      "type": "string"
    },
